abstract: "A policy-gated AI agent framework for safe onboard satellite fault response. An AI agent proposes fault-recovery actions; a deterministic policy gate — human-readable YAML written and signed by operators — rules on every proposal (AUTO, AUTO+LOG, ESCALATE, DENY) under a context-adaptive autonomy envelope, and every proposal and decision is written to a tamper-evident audit ledger. Research prototype: simulation only, not flight software. Code for the Zenodo preprint 'Guarded Autonomy for Satellites' (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23425891)."
identifiers:
